Derived work
------------

`plugin/Jellyfin.Plugin.Anemone/Transcoding/AnemoneTranscodeManager.cs` is derived from Jellyfin's
`MediaBrowser.MediaEncoding/Transcoding/TranscodeManager.cs`, as it stood at the Jellyfin v10.11.0
tag (https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin). That file, and the Jellyfin project as a whole, is
licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later, copyright the Jellyfin Contributors. The fork keeps the diff
against upstream minimal and marks every change with a `// anemone:` comment; see the file header
and PROTOCOL.md for details.

`docs/upstream-10.11.0/` holds verbatim copies of the upstream Jellyfin source files the fork above
is based on and diffed against when rebasing on a new Jellyfin minor (`ITranscodeManager.cs`,
`JobLogger.cs`, `StreamState.cs`, `TranscodeManager.cs`, `TranscodingJob.cs`,
`TranscodingSegmentCleaner.cs`, `TranscodingThrottler.cs`). These files are unmodified copies from
jellyfin/jellyfin, kept for reference only, under the same GPL-2.0-or-later license and copyright
as the project they came from.

Everything else in this repository (the rest of the plugin, the `polyp` agent, documentation,
scripts) is original work released under the same GPL-2.0-or-later license, chosen because it must
cover the derived file above — the whole repository takes the more restrictive license rather than
splitting licensing file-by-file.
